{"id": "P02", "category": "partial", "question": "本科生图书馆能借多少本书，最多能续借几次？", "arm": "jev_on", "knowledge_version": "kb-229ee34eba99ef34", "evidence_sha256": "437f86c73def7326485757ab5fa84ca4002af6d290d5e55cb43e872a67d06b69", "before_chunk_ids": ["cdut:chunk:libfaq:03", "cdut:chunk:libfaq:01", "cdut:chunk:libfresh:01", "cdut:chunk:libprint:bs01"], "after_chunk_ids": ["cdut:chunk:libfaq:03", "cdut:chunk:libfaq:01", "cdut:chunk:libfresh:01"], "latency_ms": 20735.5, "body": {"services": [], "teachers": [], "places": [], "answer": "找到相关来源：图书馆借阅数量、查找、续借、预约馆藏。本次未能整理出可靠答复，可查看下方来源。", "result_status": "limited", "answer_mode": "agent", "excerpts": [{"document": "图书馆借阅数量", "content": "图书馆FAQ中记载本科生可借40本、研究生和教职工可借50本，借期约两个月，可在到期前续借；如政策变动以图书馆系统为准。", "source_id": "cdut:source:libfaq", "chunk_id": "cdut:chunk:libfaq:03", "source_url": "https://lib.cdut.edu.cn/fw/qtfw/cjwt.htm"}, {"document": "查找、续借、预约馆藏", "content": "图书馆常见问题说明可通过馆藏目录OPAC检索图书、查馆藏情况，并进行图书续借、预约和查询借阅记录。", "source_id": "cdut:source:libfaq", "chunk_id": "cdut:chunk:libfaq:01", "source_url": "https://lib.cdut.edu.cn/fw/qtfw/cjwt.htm"}, {"document": "新生借书步骤", "content": "图书馆新生问答建议先检索馆藏目录并确定索书号和馆藏位置，再到馆藏地取书并通过自助借还设备办理手续，遇到故障可到总服务台咨询。", "source_id": "cdut:source:libfresh", "chunk_id": "cdut:chunk:libfresh:01", "source_url": "https://lib.cdut.edu.cn/xszl/nwwd/xscjwd.htm"}], "source_ids": [], "service_links": [], "plan": [], "checklist": null, "citations": [{"id": "cdut:source:libfaq", "title": "图书馆常见问题", "url": "https://lib.cdut.edu.cn/fw/qtfw/cjwt.htm", "publisher": "图书馆", "audience": {"audiences": ["all"], "academic_year": null, "valid_from": null, "valid_until": null, "source_scope": "常规说明；实际办理状态待核对"}, "date": null, "source_authority": null, "access_method": null, "source_label": null, "stale": false}, {"id": "cdut:source:libfresh", "title": "图书馆新生常见问答", "url": "https://lib.cdut.edu.cn/xszl/nwwd/xscjwd.htm", "publisher": "图书馆", "audience": {"audiences": ["all"], "academic_year": null, "valid_from": null, "valid_until": null, 